Playing 3.11 on a PC:

Having gotten the Amulet and on my way up out of hell, I was having the
usual problems with going down instead up at staircases.  I noticed that
the ring of levitation fix doesn't work anymore.  And of course I couldn't
teleport with the Amulet.

My solution was to put the Amulet into my bag of holding.  Of course 
the development team thought of that, and the bag can't contain the Amulet.
But what if the Amulet was inside of something else?  That does work, and
I was able to go up the stairs normally.  If I had really believed that
this was working I would have just level teleported to level 1.

The only trick is figuring out how to get the Amulet inside of something,
and then knowing how to get it back out.

